# Keep the build context small and reproducible:
# - never ship a local virtualenv, caches or git history into the image
# - never ship local runtime data; the ledger is a volume, not a layer
.git
.gitignore
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
runs/*.jsonl
!runs/sample_ledger.jsonl
reports/*
docs
video
*.md
!backend/README.md
LICENSE
NOTICE
REVIEW.md
